## UI
ghost-respawn-rules-window-title = Ghost Respawn Rules
ghost-respawn-rules-window-confirm-button = I understand, respawn me
ghost-gui-respawn-button-denied = Respawn ({$time}s)
ghost-gui-respawn-button-allowed = Respawn
ghost-respawn-rules-window-rules = Respawning follows a New Life Rule:
    Characters who die and return via spawning into the round
    are to act as a freshly joined participant to the round,
    and as a seperate entity to their previous self.
    Do not seek revenge or act on information related to your previous character's death,
    such as returning for your previous life’s items
    or to the location of your death.
    The exception to this is 'cryocycling' to fix bugs or cloning issues
    to reset your body.
    Review the rules for more info.
